2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Clarice and Lorenzo's children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucrezia (1470–1553), married Jacopo Salviati: their sons were Cardinals Giovanni Salviati and Bernardo Salviati, their daughter Maria Salviati was the mother of Cosimo I de' Medici, Grand Duke of Tuscany; another daughter, France
2 CONC sca Salviati was the mother of Pope Leo XI
2 CONT
2 CONT Twins died after birth (March 1471)
2 CONT
2 CONT Piero (1472–1503), ruler of Florence after his father's death; married Alfonsina Orsini
2 CONT
2 CONT Maddalena (1473–1519), married Franceschetto Cybo, illegitimate son of Pope Innocent VIII
2 CONT
2 CONT Giovanni (1475–1521) became Pope Leo X
2 CONT
2 CONT Luisa (or Luigia; 1477–1488), was betrothed to Giovanni il Popolano, but died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Contessina (1478–1515) married Piero Ridolfi
2 CONT
2 CONT Giuliano (1479–1516), Duke of Nemours, married Filiberta di Savoia
