2 CONT '''Ferdinando I de' Medici, Grand Duke of Tuscany ''' (30 July 1549 – 3 February 1609) was Grand Duke of Tuscany from 1587 to 1609, having succeeded his older brother [https://www.geni.com/people/Francesco-I-de-Medici-2-granduca-d
2 CONC i-Toscana/6000000004173966093 Francesco I], who presumably died from malaria.     {{https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Pulzone%2C_Scipione_-_Ferdinando_I_de%27_Medici%2C_granduca_di_Toscana_-_1590.jpg/220px-
