2 CONT
2 CONT Claude of Valois was born at Fontainebleau on 12 November 1547 and died in Nancy on 21 February 1575. She was the second daughter of King Henry II of France and Catherine de' Medici.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [show]
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 1 Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 2 Children
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 3 Ancestors
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 4 External links
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Claude was raised alongside her sister Elisabeth, future Queen of Spain, and sister-in-law Mary, Queen of Scots. She was married at the age of 11 to Charles III, Duke of Lorraine on 19 January 1559. Claude was victim of the unheal
2 CONC thy traits that Catherine appeared to pass on to her children (with the exception of Marguerite) and suffered from a hunchback and club foot.
2 CONT
2 CONT This very discreet princess was the favourite daughter of her mother. She often left Nancy, the capital of Lorraine, in order to live near her in the heart of France. Catherine de' Medici also liked to visit her daughter in Lorrai
2 CONC ne. Against her mother's wishes, though, Claude did try to warn her younger sister Marguerite de Valois of the danger she would face as the new wife of the Huguenot King of Navarre on the night of the St. Bartholomew's Day massacr
2 CONC e.
2 CONT
2 CONT Claude died in childbirth in 1575.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Claude and her husband had nine children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Henry II, Duke of Lorraine, 1563–1624
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Christine of Lorraine, 16 August 1565 – 19 December 1637. Married Ferdinando I de' Medici, Grand Duke of Tuscany.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Charles, 1567–1607, Cardinal of Lorraine and Bishop of Metz (1578–1607), Bishop of Strasbourg (1604–1607)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Antoinette, 1568-1610. Married Jean-Guillaume, Duke of Julich-Cleves-Berg
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Anne, 1569-1676.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Francis II, Duke of Lorraine, 1572-1632.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Catherine of Lorraine, ? - 6 Mar 1618. Married Charles I, Duke of Nevers
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Elizabeth of Lorraine, 1574-1635. Married Maximilian I, Elector of Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Claude, 1575-1576.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Catherine of Lorraine (1573 † 1648), Abesse de Remiremont
2 CONT
