2 CONT      Henry de Valois was born in 1535 at Paris, France. He was the son of Henri II, Roi de France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1590 at Paris, France. He was buried at Paris, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Henry de Valois also went by the nick-name of Batard d'Angoulême. He gained the title of Baron de Fontette.
