2 CONT 5. Leopoldo de Medici3 b. 6 Nov 1617, d. 10 Nov 1675
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 80. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession.
