1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margherita_Gonzaga,_Duchess_of_Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Margerita Gonzaga (2 October 1591-7 February 1632) was the eldest daughter of Vincenzo I Gonzaga and Eleonora de' Medici, she is also a sister of Francesco IV Gonzaga, Ferdinando I Gonzaga, Vincenzo II Gonzaga and Eleonora Gonzaga
2 CONC . Her brothers all succeded their father as Duke of Mantua and Eleonora became Holy Roman Emperess by her marriage to Ferdinand II, Holy Roman Emperor.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Henry II, Duke of Lorraine on 24 April 1606, he had previously been married Catherine of Navarre but Henry and Catherine where divorced because the marriage unhappy, childless and Catherine had refused to convert to th
2 CONC e Roman Catholic faith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry and Margerita had four children; two of them survived infancy, they were
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolette (1608–1657), married Charles IV, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Claude (1612–1648), married Nicholas II, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT The two girls married their cousins who were Henry's successors since Margerita had not given him a son.
