2 CONT
2 CONT Maurizio di Savoia, Principe di Savoia (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #114445, b. 10 January 1593, d. 4 October 1657
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=6.54%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maurizio di Savoia, Principe di Savoia was born on 10 January 1593. He was the son of Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg. (1) He married Ludovica Maria di Savoia, daughter of Vittorio Amadeo I,
2 CONC  Duca di Savoia and Marie Christine de Bourbon, Princesse de France, on 28 August 1642 at Turin, Italy.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 4 October 1657 at age 64 at Turin, Italy.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maurizio di Savoia, Principe di Savoia held the office of Cardinal of the Church of Rome. He gained the title of Principe Maurizio di Savoia. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p11445.htm#i114445
2 CONT
