2 CONT Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova 2     Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova was born on 29 July 1609.1 She was the daughter of Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova and Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia.1 She m
2 CONC arried Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel, son of Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova and Catherine de Mayenne, on 25 December 1627.1 She died on 14 August 1660 at age 51.1
2 CONT      Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova gained the title of Principessa di Mantova. Children of Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova and Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel 1.Carlo III Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova+1 b. 3 Oct 1629, d.
