2 CONC ES de Prez & his wife Nicole de Bara (Saint-Martin de Galluis, Yvelines 25 May 1670-La Queue-en-Yvelines 4 Apr 1740).  King’s lieutenant in Flanders 1720.  He called himself Marquis de La Queue. 
