2 CONT Balthasar Charles of Spain, Prince of Asturias and Portugal (Spanish:Baltasar Carlos; Portuguese:Baltazar Carlos) was the eldest son of King Philip IV of Spain and III of Portugal and his first wife, Elisabeth of Bourbon. He was b
2 CONC orn on 17 October 1629 in Madrid, and died 9 October 1646 in Zaragoza at the age of sixteen. He bore the titles Prince of Asturias and Prince of Portugal. Prince Baltasar Carlos was depicted in a number of portraits by Diego de Ve
2 CONC lázquez.
