1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Merchant and Consul of the Florentine nation in Lisbon in 1685, Administrator of the galleys in Florence in 1696, Senator of Florence on August 14, 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 17th century the Florentines were still an important presence in the Portuguese economic scenario.Among them were the Ginori with their own trading house in Lisbon, which was managed by Lorenzo for more than twenty years. Loren
