2 CONT    Louise Marie Anne de Bourbon was born illegitimately on 12 November 1674 at Saint-Germain-en-Laye, Île-de-France, France. (1) She was the daughter of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 15 September 1681 at age 6 at Bourbon-l'Archambault, France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Louise Marie Anne de Bourbon was also known as Mademiselle de Tours. (1) In January 1676 her birth was legitimised. (1)
