2 CONC ourbon, daughter of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart, on 18 February 1692 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 2 December 1723 at age 49 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France, from apoplexy. (3) He was buried at Saint-Denis, Île-de-France, France.3
2 CONT
