2 CONT
2 CONT Philippe Charles d'Orléans
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	Philippe I, Duke of Orléans
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Elizabeth Charlotte of the Palatinate
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	2 August 1674(1674-08-02)
2 CONT
2 CONT Château de Saint-Cloud, Saint-Cloud, France
2 CONT
