2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Victor of Savoy, Prince of Carignan (25 September 1721, Paris – 16 December 1778) was a Savoyard Prince and the Prince of Carignan from 1741 till his death. He was Luigi-Vittorio di Savoia, principe di Carignano in Italian.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [hide]
2 CONT
