2 CONT Louis, Duke of Burgundy (1682–1712)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT For other uses of "Louis, Dauphin", see Louis, Dauphin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke of Burgundy
2 CONT
