2 CONC rt de Saint-Amand, Arthur; Léon Imbert de Saint-Amand, Elizabeth Gilbert Martin (1915). The Youth of the Duchess of Angoulême. University of Michigan: C. Scribner's sons. p. 118. 3.^ McCarthy, Justin Huntly (1897). The French Revo
