1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://cc.bingj.com/cache.aspx?q=Carolina+Ratti%2c+1805-1881&d=4881866560374003&mkt=nl-BE&setlang=en-US&w=7946317c,4cc4ced7 wikipedia, en.....] - Bartolomeo's ancestor & his descendants ;
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartolomeo dei Principi Ruspoli (October 26, 1800 – 1872), married Carolina Ratti (1805–1881), and had eight children:
2 CONT
2 CONT >#    Francesca dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, May 31, 1830 – Florence, December 14, 1902), married firstly in Rome, December 21, 1852 Giovanni Torlonia dei Duchi di Poli e Guadagnolo and secondly in Basel, November 4, 1863 Nikolai .
2 CONC ..vich Kisselev (? – 1869)
2 CONT >#    Giacinta dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, 1832 – Montefalconara, July 6, 1902), married Tommaso, Marchese Lecce
2 CONT >#    Paolo dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, January 10, 1835 – Florence, April 26, 1913), married firstly in Paris Frances Yorke (1838 – March 9, 1874), and had issue, and secondly in Paris November 4, 1888 Rosalie van Zandt (New York
2 CONC  City, New York – Florence, July 8, 1914), formerly Mrs. Joseph Karrick Riggs, without issue:
2 CONT >>#        Elena dei Principi Ruspoli (Terni, 1867 – Rome, January 8, 1909), married Roberto Paganini (Agordo, May 6, 1849 – October 29, 1912)
2 CONT >>#        Leopolda dei Principi Ruspoli (Geneva, February 15, 1869 – ?), married in Paris, July 24, 1890 Tankerville James Chamberlayne
2 CONT >>#        Laura dei Principi Ruspoli (Geneva, 1872 – San Faustino, September 5, 1932), married in Rome, December 17, 1894 Constantin, Prince Vogoride (1849 – ?)[1]
2 CONT >#    Emanuele Ruspoli, 1st Prince of Poggio Suasa, ancestor of the Line III of the Principi Ruspoli
2 CONT >#   Luigi dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, June 21, 1843 – Rome, June 20, 1904), married in Rome Clelia dei Conti Balboni (? – December 31, 1922), and had four children:
2 CONT >>#        Bartolomeo dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, January 1, 1874 – 1923), unmarried and without issue
2 CONT >>#        Enrico dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, July 25, 1878 – Nemi, December 4, 1909), married in Washington, DC, March 2, 1901 Eugenia Enfield Berry (Rome, Floyd County, Georgia, ca 1870 – 1951), formerly Mrs. Henry Bruton, witho
2 CONC ut issue
2 CONT >>#        Umberto dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, November 12, 1879 – August 18, 1926), unmarried and without issue
2 CONT >>#        Maria dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, May 18, 1888 – Aix-en-Provence, August 6, 1976), married firstly in Paris, August 3, 1907 as his second wife Antoine XI, 11th Duc de Gramont (Paris, September 22, 1851 – Paris, January 
2 CONC 30, 1925), without issue and secondly in Paris, July 23, 1934 as his first wife François Victor-Hugo (Fiesole, April 30, 1889 – Aix-en-Provence, December 29, 1981), great-grandson of Victor Hugo, without issue
2 CONT >#    Leopolda dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, February 10, 1846 – ?), married Giannuzzi Savelli
2 CONT >#    Clelia dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, July 4, 1848 – ?), unmarried and without issue
2 CONT >#    Ortensia dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, September 11, 1850 – ?), unmarried and without issue
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
