1 CONT of Guise and Cardinal Charles of Lorraine, the uncles of his wife. These two
1 CONT men,who in effect were the rulers during Francis's brief reign (1559-60) tried
1 CONT to repress the growing political power of the Protestants in France. His death
1 CONT ended the ascendncy of the Guises at court.  aka: Francois II.
