1 CONT Mary was James' daughter, who married William of Orange.  As to the crown of
1 CONT Great Britain, William (William III) & Mary ruled jointly until Mary died in
1 CONT 1694. Then William died on March 19, 1702, when Mary's sister, Queen Anne,
1 CONT succeeded to the throne of Great Britain.
1 CONT .
