0 @N6000000002322305580@ NOTE When her husband died, he was deserted by all his friends, his efforts to
1 CONT achieve freedom and general welfare for his subjects seemed to have been in
1 CONT vain. Today, Joseph is generally judged differently. He is considered the
1 CONT benefactor of his subjects, the people's emperor, who, by his many voyages &
1 CONT inspections devoted himself to all matters of greater or lessor importance. In
1 CONT his century, he had predicted there would be a time when general welfare took
1 CONT precedence over individual prosperity. But he was born a century too early.
